@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+---
+id: task-001-implement-json-pointer-resolution
+type: task
+title: "Implement JSON Pointer resolution"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement and export `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` according to RFC 6901. Add deterministic
+tests for root, object, array, escaping, and invalid or unresolvable pointers, and document the
+public API.
+
+Implemented the resolver in `src/index.ts`, including strict reference-token decoding, canonical
+array-index handling, and own-member lookup. Added RFC-oriented tests and TypeScript build support;
+`npm test` passes.
